WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.000
HAILEE STEINFELD
In our new series Hawkeye, Clint Barton

00:00:02.045 --> 00:00:04.581
may have met his equal with
his new teammate, Kate Bishop.

00:00:04.632 --> 00:00:06.195
JEREMY RENNER
That's debatable. But right now we're

00:00:06.246 --> 00:00:08.531
going to see who's the better
marksman, me or Hailee.

00:00:08.585 --> 00:00:09.843
HAILEE STEINFELD
You're going down, Renner.

00:00:09.894 --> 00:00:11.750
JEREMY RENNER
We'll see about that.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:17.639
- Just hit a balloon.
- Just shush.

00:00:18.787 --> 00:00:20.375
- Boom! I'll take it.
- Got it, nice.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:22.757
- Shoot.
- Well, you're consistent.

00:00:22.808 --> 00:00:23.811
HAILEE STEINFELD
Thank you, go on.

00:00:23.862 --> 00:00:25.862
HAILEE STEINFELD
Ah! No! I swear...

00:00:27.148 --> 00:00:29.609
I- this is a joke. This is rigged.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.726
Ha! It's not, I'm
just kidding. Woo!

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:33.960
JEREMY RENNER
You got it.

00:00:35.385 --> 00:00:37.216
- Ohhhh!
- Yeah!

00:00:37.248 --> 00:00:38.263
HAILEE STEINFELD
Yeah, baby!

00:00:38.608 --> 00:00:39.608
HAILEE STEINFELD
Cornhole.

00:00:39.977 --> 00:00:41.200
JEREMY RENNER
Pizza Dog cornhole.

00:00:41.251 --> 00:00:42.251
HAILEE STEINFELD
Alright.

00:00:42.365 --> 00:00:43.365
- Nice.
- Boom.

00:00:44.581 --> 00:00:46.795
- Close. Doh! Sorry.
- Ahhh... That was good defense though.

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.387
HAILEE STEINFELD
[Laughing]

00:00:52.148 --> 00:00:53.591
- [Laughing]
- What's next?

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:57.920
[Laughter]

00:00:58.685 --> 00:01:00.685
- Ohhh-ho! There it is.
- Ohhh!

00:01:01.137 --> 00:01:03.481
JEREMY RENNER
The action is just tremendous... Oh, Thanos!

00:01:03.532 --> 00:01:04.794
HAILEE STEINFELD
You weren't even looking!

00:01:05.896 --> 00:01:06.896
[Laughter]

00:01:07.786 --> 00:01:08.786
- Hey!
- There you go!

00:01:09.007 --> 00:01:12.062
HAILEE STEINFELD
Oh! And I still missed it! Grrrr!

00:01:12.602 --> 00:01:13.304
[Laughing]

00:01:13.355 --> 00:01:14.355
HAILEE STEINFELD
Well, that was fun!

00:01:14.406 --> 00:01:16.210
JEREMY RENNER
More fun than shooting exploding arrows?

00:01:16.261 --> 00:01:17.261
HAILEE STEINFELD
No, of course not,

00:01:17.289 --> 00:01:18.289
nothing's more fun than that.

